{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"7d6d450f7274ed04","type":"text","text":"> “Every aspect of learning or any other feature of intelligence can in principle be so precisely described that a machine can be made to simulate it.”\n\n  \n— John McCarthy et al., \"A Proposal for the Dartmouth Summer Research Project on Artificial Intelligence,\" 1955","x":-264,"y":500,"width":520,"height":123},
		{"id":"76acdc4ceb351ea3","type":"text","text":"We define intelligence so we may create systems that solve problems intelligently.","x":-140,"y":660,"width":272,"height":87},
		{"id":"7c89e4022dc01c20","type":"text","text":"#### Why do we define intelligence?","x":-264,"y":400,"width":520,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"75efa8c2f712c788","type":"text","text":"_Defining intelligence is controversial, and historically even dangerous. I will provide this definition, but it is not everyone's._\n\n**Intelligence is the ability of [[Intelligence is rapid|rapid]], [[Intelligence is fluid|fluid]], [[Intelligence is generalizable|generalizable]], [[Intelligence is durable|durable]] [[learning]].**\n","x":-264,"y":192,"width":520,"height":148},
		{"id":"15bce32df090eb87","type":"file","file":"index.md","x":360,"y":166,"width":520,"height":200},
		{"id":"567d9413fe304df2","type":"text","text":"#### What is still unknown about intelligence?","x":-264,"y":1650,"width":520,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"c0da5ecdc889ab6e","type":"text","text":"#### What is intelligence made of and where is it?","x":-264,"y":1240,"width":520,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"a391b0e0c3ba5284","type":"text","text":"#### What is intelligence made of and where is it?","x":-264,"y":800,"width":520,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"2ff1841878e10c6c","type":"text","text":"Intelligence can exist in many different ways, and there has been extensive debate about whether human intelligence is strictly due to the capabilities of neurons (see: connectionist versus symbolic AI)","x":-264,"y":940,"width":520,"height":220},
		{"id":"e496190cd4894a5c","type":"file","file":"👶 How does intelligence develop?/👶 The newborn brain.md","x":411,"y":830,"width":509,"height":212},
		{"id":"b075e6474e221eaa","type":"file","file":"👶 How does intelligence develop?/The slime mold brain.md","x":411,"y":1100,"width":509,"height":170},
		{"id":"21a76dfccc8f5168","type":"file","file":"🤖 What are we missing about intelligence?/🤖What open questions remain in intelligence?.md","x":-264,"y":1760,"width":520,"height":200},
		{"id":"952d140b446dff2c","type":"file","file":"🧠 Where is intelligence located?/🧠 What is the substance of intelligence?.md","x":-264,"y":1360,"width":520,"height":240},
		{"id":"b15fb411d952e5d4","type":"text","text":"#### How do we define intelligence?","x":-264,"y":100,"width":520,"height":50,"color":"2"}
